msgid "All four are on by default. Switching one off hides it: the column and the filter in the page list, the facet on a handbook's entry page, the badge on a page and on a card, and the field in the editor sidebar. An import stops reading its line as well."
msgstr ""

#: src/Setup/Settings.php:731
msgid "Nothing is deleted. The terms stay, the pages keep them, and switching one back on brings every assignment back exactly as it was. A bundle export carries all four either way, so moving a handbook to another site never loses what this site happens to hide."
