#: src/Setup/Settings.php:744
msgid "Off by default. A learning path is an ordered selection of pages that already exist in a handbook, for onboarding or for a piece of required reading. The pages stay where they are: a path only says which of them to read in which order."
msgstr ""

#: src/Setup/Settings.php:745
msgid "This first stage keeps no progress on the server. How far somebody has read is remembered in their browser and nowhere else, so nothing personal is stored, and the record is gone when they clear their browser data or change device. It is a guided path, not a record of attendance."
msgstr ""

